 "summary": "Intern E013 Ethan Brooks (Engineering) works from home on Fridays (agreed with manager Marcus). From home he cannot reach the internal wiki or the code repo (git). He asks whether VPN is needed for these. A VPN access request (standard system, manager approval) has been filed for him. Please confirm whether VPN is the right fix for wiki/repo access from home and whether anything else is needed."
