{
 "kind": "done",
 "message": "Hi Ethan! I've filed a VPN access request for you (REQ-1001). It's routed to your manager, Marcus Webb, for approval. Access isn't active until he signs off. VPN is a standard system, so interns can request it.\n\nOn whether VPN is what you need for the wiki and repo from home: that's a technical question I can't answer from policy, so I've passed it to the IT team (ticket ESC-1002). They'll confirm whether VPN fixes it or if anything else is needed.\n\nWorking from home on Fridays is covered by the remote work policy (POL-REM-01), which lets office staff work remotely up to 2 days a week when agreed with their manager. Since Marcus agreed, you're set on that side.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-ACC-01",
  "POL-ACC-02",
  "POL-REM-01"
 ]
}
